<title>USA: Allied Products to buy back 1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Allied Products to buy back 1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Products Corp said on Wednesday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to one million more shares of the company's common stock.  </p>
<p>The repurchase authorization is in addition to a 500,000 share repurchase plan approved earlier this year, of which 400,000 shares have already been bought back, the company said.</p>
<p>Allied Products is a manufacturer of metal stamping presses and agricultural equipment and supplier of thermoplastic compounds and additives.</p>
<p>Allied Products shares were up 7/8 at 25-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787)).</p>
